stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> prechecking
 prechecking --> needs_clarification: 必需条件不足
 prechecking --> drafting: 条件明确
 needs_clarification --> drafting: 人工补充并核查
 drafting --> awaiting_review
 awaiting_review --> approved: 明确批准完整固定计划
 approved --> running: 每步授权/依赖/预算核验
 running --> completed: 全部必要步骤有证据
 running --> paused: 暂停请求；在途步骤安全收尾
 running --> blocked: 研究条件或授权冲突
 running --> failed: 执行失败且不可重试
 running --> interrupted: 进程中断/结果未知
 running --> cancelled: 取消请求安全收尾
 paused --> reconciling: 用户确认恢复
 interrupted --> reconciling: 核对旧进程及已有Run
 failed --> reconciling: 人工核查允许恢复且预算未耗尽
 reconciling --> running: 唯一结果归属与原批准仍有效
 reconciling --> blocked: 证据归属不明或批准失效
 blocked --> awaiting_review: 新候选/重新审批
 completed --> [*]
 cancelled --> [*]
 note right of cancelled
  已保存结果不删除；
  重开为后继任务，不静默恢复。
 end note
